  <h2>The Challenge: Stagnant SKUs</h2>
  <p>An established UK fitness boutique came to us with a problem: their marketing was working, but their SKU count was too low to drive repeat purchases. They were tied to a traditional supplier with 120-day lead times for new designs.</p>

  <img src="https://sc01.alicdn.com/kf/H88eedc1321c748f4a1a389688f71d995E.png" alt="Fitclo High-Quality Sets for UK Partner" class="w-full rounded-2xl my-8 shadow-xl" />

  <h3>The Strategy: Hybrid Inventory</h3>
  <p>We implemented a **Hybrid Sourcing Strategy**:
  1. **Core OEM:** We manufactured their 5 core best-sellers in bulk.
  2. **Agile Stock:** Every two weeks, they selected 5-8 new trendy styles from our **Weekly Drops**.
  3. **Premium Branding:** We applied their logo, tags, and custom frosted packaging to all items, ensuring a unified brand look.</p>

  <h3>The Results: Revenue Tripled</h3>
  <p>By moving to this model, the brand went from 5 styles to 50 styles in just 90 days. The results were immediate:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Repeat Purchase Rate:</strong> Increased by 45% as customers had a reason to return to the site every week.</li>
    <li><strong>Inventory Risk:</strong> Reduced by 60%, as they only "committed" to high volume once a style was market-proven.</li>
    <li><strong>Lead Time:</strong> Reduced from 4 months to just 14 days for new arrivals.</li>
  </ul>

  <img src="https://sc01.alicdn.com/kf/H50826dc1f6404832b9ce88c2d4f8edcbE.jpg" alt="Custom Branded Packaging for UK Distribution" class="w-full rounded-2xl my-8 shadow-xl" />

  <p>Today, this brand is one of the top-performing niche labels in the UK. They rely on Fitclo as their "Supply Chain Partner," not just a factory, to handle their entire product lifecycle from design to DDP logistics.</p>
